MTMB_TEXT(
    AboutBody,
    L"Adds move buttons to visible windows, including background windows.\nTwo displays: one button. Three or more: previous/next in display-number order, with wraparound.\nRight-click to choose a destination; hover to see its number.\n\nNo DLL injection, keyboard hooks, or network access.\nOptional sign-in startup is available in the tray menu (off by default).\nThe app checks the actual input window as well as its parent.\nUse the tray menu if a title-bar button is unavailable.\n\nMoving a maximized window briefly restores it.\nThe tray offers diagnostics and per-window estimated placement.\nEstimated placement may overlap tabs or controls. Administrator access is never requested automatically.")
